---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="联系我们与建站咨询 | Wix Studio 官方认证定制服务 - wixstudio.cn"
  description="告诉我们您的网站建设或出海官网需求。Wix 官方最高级 Legend 认证合作伙伴，提供专业 Wix Studio 外贸独立站、品牌官网定制与技术开发咨询。"
  keywords="Wix 代建站, Wix 建站服务, Wix Studio 定制, Wix 外贸建站, Wix 专家咨询"
>
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-dots-light">
    <div class="hero-glow-light opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14 space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-[#6D28D9] text-xs font-semibold border border-purple-200">
          START A PROJECT
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#0F172A] tracking-tight">
          开启您的 <span class="text-gradient-brand">Wix Studio 项目</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600">
          无论您是有建站定制需求、企业内部培训，还是寻求战略合作，请随时与我们联络。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
        <!-- Form Column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 light-card p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/50">
          <form class="space-y-5" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('感谢您的咨询！我们会尽快与您取得联系。');">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                您的称呼 / 姓名 *
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                required
                placeholder="例如：张经理 / Alex"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 placeholder-gray-400 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                  微信号 / 手机 *
                </label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  required
                  placeholder="便于即时沟通方案"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 placeholder-gray-400 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition"
                />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                  电子邮箱
                </label>
                <input
                  type="email"
                  placeholder="name@company.com"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 placeholder-gray-400 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                网站类型 / 核心目标
              </label>
              <select class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition">
                <option value="b2b">外贸出海 B2B 品牌企业官网</option>
                <option value="ecom">跨境独立站 / 电子商务网店</option>
                <option value="portfolio">创意设计 / 个人作品集 / 自由职业展示</option>
                <option value="custom">定制开发 (含 Velo 代码或复杂交互)</option>
                <option value="other">技术指导 / 疑难排错 / 其他合作</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                预估预算范围
              </label>
              <select class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition">
                <option value="under5k">¥5,000 以下 (基础展示型)</option>
                <option value="5k-15k">¥5,000 - ¥15,000 (精品出海标准官网)</option>
                <option value="15k-30k">¥15,000 - ¥30,000 (高水准定制与动效商城)</option>
                <option value="over30k">¥30,000 以上 (集团级全案或复杂动态平台)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">
                需求详细描述
              </label>
              <textarea
                rows="4"
                placeholder="例如：您心仪的参考网站、预期上线时间、需要包含哪些主要板块..."
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 placeholder-gray-400 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6D28D9] focus:bg-white transition resize-none"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <button
              type="submit"
              class="btn-primary-glow w-full py-3.5 rounded-full font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6D28D9] to-[#2563EB] shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/20 transition cursor-pointer"
            >
              提交咨询信息 →
            </button>
            <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400">
              我们重视您的信息隐私，承诺在 24 小时内由资深官方认证顾问与您对接。
            </p>
          </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Contact Info & Badge Column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
          <!-- Legend Badge Card -->
          <div class="light-card p-6 border-2 border-purple-200/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50/50 to-white space-y-4 shadow-md">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <img
                src="/assets/badges/wix-partner-legend-200.png"
                alt="Wix Partner Legend"
                width="72"
                height="72"
                class="rounded-full shadow-md shadow-gray-900/20"
              />
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6D28D9]">WIX PARTNER LEGEND</div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0F172A]">官方最高级认证合作伙伴</h3>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">5年+ 实战，服务超数十家出海企业</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-purple-100">
              依托 Wix Studio 全端流体响应式架构与 Velo 动态数据库能力，为企业量身定制兼具硅谷级美学设计与出色 Google 搜索引擎排名的出海门户。
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Direct WeChat card -->
          <div class="light-card p-6 border border-gray-200 space-y-3">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400">即时沟通</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-[#0F172A] font-semibold">想要立即交流方案或发送参考链接？</div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-gray-600">微信 / 商务联络：</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#6D28D9] font-bold">wixstudio_cn</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-gray-600">商务邮箱：</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-gray-900 font-semibold">contact@wixstudio.cn</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Process Highlights -->
          <div class="light-card p-6 border border-gray-200 space-y-3">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400">标准服务交付流程</div>
            <ol class="space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-[#6D28D9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</span> 需求沟通与参考风格对齐</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-[#6D28D9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</span> 首页与核心版面原型确认</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-[#6D28D9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">3</span> 响应式制作与动效交互开发</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-[#6D28D9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">4</span> 域名配置、SEO检验与后台培训交付</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
